## Repository Structure \& File Index

|File / Folder|Description|
|-|-|
|`reproducible\_statistical\_audit.py`|Primary executable Python 3.12 script performing all data validation, FCIs calculation, Spearman correlations, Tobit MLE regression, and Logistic regression.|
|`Deidentified\_Dataset\_N303.csv`|Complete de-identified dataset ($N = 303$, 40 variables) with synthetic participant IDs (`P001`–`P303`).|
|`SAP\_STATISTICAL\_ANALYSIS\_PLAN\_v1.0.txt`|Formal Statistical Analysis Plan (v1.0) defining hypotheses, variable operationalization, and model specifications.|
|`STROBE\_CHECKLIST\_v1.1.txt`|STROBE observational study compliance checklist (95.5% full compliance).|
|`SUPPLEMENTARY\_MATERIALS\_INDEX.txt`|Index mapping supplementary tables (S1–S8) and visual figures (Figures 1, 2, 3).|
|`requirements.txt`|Exact Python package version specifications.|
|`CITATION.cff`|Machine-readable citation file format metadata.|
|`LICENSE`|MIT License terms for open-source code and data reuse.|

